# Build products, logs, generated artifacts, and resolved dependency trees belong under
# /opt/laplace. They are intentionally not ignored here: an accidental repository-local
# output must be visible to Git rather than silently accumulating beneath the checkout.

# Managed and web outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Python interpreter state
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Editors and operating systems
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets and local machine state
*.env
*.secret
local/
